Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.54,0:00:07.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Based on the number of taps,\Nit should be coming from this direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.25,0:00:09.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:13.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Something big is headed here...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.96,0:00:16.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that... a dragon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:18.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, it's a wyvern!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.92,0:00:20.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.58,0:00:46.17,Song,,0,0,0,,Masshiro hikari no naka me o samashite\Nhajimatteiku sutoorii
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.17,0:00:52.88,Song,,0,0,0,,Fumidasu atarashii sekai donna hana o sakaseyou?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.08,0:01:00.46,Song,,0,0,0,,Kumori sora datte mizutamari de yogoretatte
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:03.33,Song,,0,0,0,,Bokura wa susumu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.33,0:01:10.08,Song,,0,0,0,,Souzou mo shinai mirai ga matteiru kitto
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.38,0:01:13.96,Song,,0,0,0,,Deatte deatte tsunagatteku
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.96,0:01:17.25,Song,,0,0,0,,Waraeba mawari mo egao ni naru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.25,0:01:21.29,Song,,0,0,0,,Chiisana tane maite sodateyou
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.29,0:01:25.38,Song,,0,0,0,,Yagate ookina hana ni naru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.38,0:01:28.88,Song,,0,0,0,,Koukai ya shippai wa kate ni shite
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.88,0:01:32.17,Song,,0,0,0,,Karafuru na shiawase de afureru youni
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.17,0:01:36.38,Song,,0,0,0,,Bokura te o toriatte wakeatte
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.21,0:02:18.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I never expected a monster like that\Nto show up here...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.63,0:02:20.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Should I try to drive it away?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.21,0:02:22.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, maybe it'll just ignore us\Nand pass through here...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.17,0:02:26.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lu, defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.17,0:02:37.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We need to put out the fires!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.17,0:02:41.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.42,0:02:43.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Should we attack it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.33,0:02:45.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not even sure we can pierce its barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.83,0:02:48.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need to make a decision, and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.38,0:02:50.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Should we try to escape into the forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.33,0:02:53.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, that won't work.\NHe can follow us from the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.29,0:02:56.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just need to drive him away... but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.58,0:02:59.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't worry about that now.\NI need to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.13,0:03:01.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need to protect everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.71,0:03:13.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is this a spear?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:15.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.54,0:03:17.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter. Right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.75,0:03:19.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take this power...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.75,0:03:22.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and crush him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.17,0:03:34.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.46,0:03:56.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We managed to put out all the fires.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.08,0:03:59.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There was some damage to the crop fields,\Nbut all of the buildings are fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.63,0:04:00.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.46,0:04:07.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looks like I managed to take it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:10.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are there are lot of these creatures?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:12.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, there are some places where they live...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.71,0:04:16.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but running into one of them that's\Nthis large is a very rare occurrence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.83,0:04:21.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is there any possibility that someone sent\Nthis wyvern here specifically to attack us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.17,0:04:23.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.13,0:04:25.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even if this wyvern was under\Nsomeone's command,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.67,0:04:30.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,they wouldn't send such a rare and\Nvaluable creature off on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.17,0:04:32.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was most likely\Na wild creature acting alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.58,0:04:34.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.04,0:04:36.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So then, I guess we can safely say
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.33,0:04:38.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that this was nothing more than\Nan unfortunate but rare incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.83,0:04:41.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.00,0:04:42.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.71,0:04:45.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can we eat this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.67,0:04:50.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wyvern meat is said to be a delicacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.96,0:04:52.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In fact, it's said to be so delicious
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.96,0:04:55.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that supposedly there was once a king\Nwho sent his army into a den of wyverns
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.42,0:04:58.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to hunt them and bring them back for\Nthe king to taste and see for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.58,0:05:02.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure that story ended with\Nthem all getting burned to death
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.33,0:05:05.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and then swallowed whole by the wyverns.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.75,0:05:08.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here's the meat in question.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.00,0:05:12.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is a wyvern round steak,\Ngrilled with spices.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.17,0:05:16.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wrapped the breast meat in leaves\Nand steamed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.92,0:05:19.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And for the tail meat, I simmered it\Ninto a stew with vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.79,0:05:26.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I thought it would be really tough,\Nbut this meat is so tender!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.25,0:05:30.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And to think, a regular knife\Ncouldn't even pierce its skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.50,0:05:33.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thif delicafy if ewy fit as dewifish as if loofs!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.75,0:05:35.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't understand any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.00,0:05:36.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mmm... this broth is great.\N{\rSubtitle-2}I faid...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.38,0:05:38.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mmm... this broth is great.\N{\rSubtitle-2}Swallow your food first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.50,0:05:41.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Every bite I take of this tail meat\Nhas more flavor than the last!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.63,0:05:47.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, would you have been able\Nto block an attack
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.00,0:05:48.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,from that spear like\Nthe one he used back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.83,0:05:50.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.33,0:05:53.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That attack pierced a\N3-layer barrier from a wyvern
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.21,0:05:56.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and then proceeded to\Nblow right through its chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.17,0:05:59.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe it was actually a stroke of luck
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.58,0:06:02.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that Kuro and the dogs were who\Nwe ran into first when we came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.17,0:06:03.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.58,0:06:05.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.75,0:06:07.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did I not get all the bones out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.25,0:06:11.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, it's just... we think we're blessed to\Nbe able to enjoy our meals in good health.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.42,0:06:14.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We were just thanking fate\Nfor smiling upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.17,0:06:15.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's not that big of a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.17,0:06:17.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This one's delicious, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.46,0:06:18.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It really is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.83,0:06:27.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You say a wyvern was felled?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.17,0:06:28.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Enough of these jokes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.46,0:06:30.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, the report we received is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.75,0:06:32.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:36.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One of those simply drawing near requires\Nthat we mobilize our entire military force!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.29,0:06:37.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.63,0:06:40.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He was attacked from the ground\Nand killed in two hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:41.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:43.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Enough of these jokes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.17,0:06:44.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.67,0:06:46.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No way. We can't fight something like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.75,0:06:49.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And we just finished getting\Nthis year's budget approved!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.88,0:06:50.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.71,0:06:51.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a joke, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.79,0:06:53.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stop saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.42,0:06:56.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now then, before fear and panic\Nbegin to spread among our citizens,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.50,0:06:58.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it's our job as the four generals\Nto handle this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.63,0:06:59.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.75,0:07:01.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's resign.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.00,0:07:02.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:04.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please don't run away from this, Randan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.25,0:07:11.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you see that, Gucci?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.42,0:07:14.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I saw it with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.00,0:07:18.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And what do you think would happen\Nif I were to receive such an attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.63,0:07:20.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It would mostly likely\Npierce cleanly through you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.33,0:07:23.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.83,0:07:25.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It would be foolish to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.04,0:07:27.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.13,0:07:38.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The wyvern meat was every bit\Nas delicious as it was said to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.04,0:07:42.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But if I'm being honest, there's still\None thing that was missing from the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.29,0:07:45.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, are we going to start now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.67,0:07:47.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is it finally time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.58,0:07:49.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.83,0:07:52.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're making alcohol!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.54,0:07:57.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we're making alcohol out of grapes,\Nthen it's going to be wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.21,0:08:00.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Apparently, wine exists in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.08,0:08:03.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, everyone was excited to make it\Nand quickly harvested all the grapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.83,0:08:07.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now all that's left is to squash the grapes\Nand let them ferment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.79,0:08:09.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and to do that, we built...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.08,0:08:12.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.96,0:08:14.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're going to walk on top of these?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.83,0:08:17.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Make sure to stomp them really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.21,0:08:20.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm a little hesitant to stomp on\Nsomething that we're going to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.71,0:08:23.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you get tired, you can have\Nsomeone switch in for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.33,0:08:24.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.71,0:08:28.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm in charge of switching\Nthe barrels as they fill up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.46,0:08:32.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, these barrels were\Nbuilt by the high elf Lalasha
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.42,0:08:34.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,because she knows how to make\Ncontainers that are water tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.08,0:08:34.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Okay!\N{\rSubtitle}because she knows how to make{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}containers that are water tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.79,0:08:37.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I had her make them right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.29,0:08:40.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Alright, you guys can start now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.79,0:08:46.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You really sink into them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.88,0:08:48.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Am I doing it right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.29,0:08:49.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.83,0:08:52.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Starting moving in a circular motion\Naround the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.33,0:08:54.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.21,0:08:57.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's go in this direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.21,0:08:58.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.17,0:09:06.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Careful not to slip and fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.71,0:09:07.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.75,0:09:16.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.25,0:09:18.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I think so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.38,0:09:23.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that I bumped into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.17,0:09:25.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not at all. That was my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.00,0:09:30.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know, I think this would be easier\Nif we had a way to help keep our rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.75,0:09:33.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,One... Two... One... Two...\N{\rSubtitle}It might keep all of our movements in sync.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.17,0:09:35.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hm, good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.04,0:09:40.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know, we can use that song
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.92,0:09:43.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we used to sing in our village\Nwhile we were all working together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.88,0:09:45.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah! That just might work!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.75,0:09:47.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A song?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.42,0:09:49.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes. It goes like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.75,0:09:52.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.46,0:10:23.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looks like they found their rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.33,0:10:25.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.13,0:10:28.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.13,0:10:30.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, then you're coming with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.33,0:10:31.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? But I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.54,0:10:32.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.33,0:10:33.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.46,0:10:34.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.75,0:10:35.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.00,0:10:45.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was a lot of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.54,0:10:49.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted, but that was a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.00,0:10:54.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now the yeast on the skin of the grapes\Nshould ferment this for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.79,0:10:57.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder if we made too much...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:10:59.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.50,0:11:02.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll drink it all right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.00,0:11:04.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can't wait to drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.67,0:11:06.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me we didn't make enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.25,0:11:10.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,See? Look how much fun he's having.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.54,0:11:13.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, can't you forgive me\Nfor what I've done already?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.00,0:11:14.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.04,0:11:18.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You mistakenly punished\Nan innocent human's soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.42,0:11:20.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and sneakily tried to save him,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.25,0:11:23.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,only to end up sending him to\Nthat horrible Forest of Death!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.25,0:11:26.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On top of that, you gave him that spear!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.17,0:11:29.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you gave him\Na replica of the holy lance Gryme!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.04,0:11:32.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, um... right now he's only\Nusing it as a farming tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.63,0:11:34.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Plus, I got permission first, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.63,0:11:37.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You didn't tell me you were\Ngiving that to a human!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.21,0:11:40.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That thing should drain all of their\Nlife force and kill them instantly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.96,0:11:43.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But he's doing fine right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.50,0:11:46.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that he just has\Nsuper-fast recovery abilities
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.50,0:11:49.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,because I gave him such a healthy body...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.13,0:11:51.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you that you were too careless!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:53.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And besides that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.04,0:11:54.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And besides that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.21,0:12:00.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why is the statue that's\Nsupposed to be me an old man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.71,0:12:03.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.04,0:12:04.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear any excuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.21,0:12:06.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As punishment, you're going to sit there\Nlike that for 300 years, my careless father!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.88,0:12:09.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me, my daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.96,0:12:27.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling a strong sense of déjà vu here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.00,0:12:28.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Flora?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:29.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My dear sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.38,0:12:31.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,So, they're actually related somehow.\N{\rSubtitle}My dear sister!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.96,0:12:32.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.17,0:12:37.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After I heard you were being chased by\Nthat infamous black-hearted angel,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.92,0:12:39.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I followed you all the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.58,0:12:41.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who did you say was black-hearted?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.46,0:12:43.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why is she here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.33,0:12:45.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was just an expression!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.33,0:12:48.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Apparently, Flora is also a vampire.\N{\rSubtitle}It's something I used to hear Lu say very often.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.71,0:12:49.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, did Lu say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.08,0:12:50.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,And she's related to Lu.\N{\rSubtitle}Oh, did Lu say that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.88,0:12:52.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh sister, please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.13,0:12:57.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well since you're here, why not relax\Nand stay with us for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.29,0:12:58.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.96,0:13:01.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm having a hard time believing that\Nthis man here is Lu's husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.79,0:13:03.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Something feels off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.42,0:13:06.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, never mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.46,0:13:09.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's the one who's in charge here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.21,0:13:11.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and he's the master of\Nall these inferno wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.75,0:13:13.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He even took down a wyvern.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.17,0:13:15.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I understand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:18.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I humbly apologize for my rude behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.04,0:13:19.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.75,0:13:21.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So anyways...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.25,0:13:24.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You guys are wolves, Kuro?\NI had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.17,0:13:27.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's the inferno part mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.83,0:13:31.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow! That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.00,0:13:34.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've been living with them\Nthis whole time and didn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.54,0:13:37.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I believe they're quite well-known\Nmagical beasts...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.79,0:13:43.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess you can think of this\Nas sort of an apology
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.83,0:13:45.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,for what Kuro and the wolves\Nput you through.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.92,0:13:47.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We went ahead and prepared dinner for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.50,0:13:52.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.33,0:13:55.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is all fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.17,0:13:57.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's the soft, white stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.54,0:13:59.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's called tofu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:01.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After a lot of tries, I finally got it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.88,0:14:04.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're made from a type of bean\Ncalled soybeans.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.00,0:14:06.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, this made from beans?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.92,0:14:10.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Flavoring soup with salt is fine and all,\Nbut I really wanted some miso.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.00,0:14:14.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Plus, I wanted to be able to put\Nsoy sauce on stuff I eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.54,0:14:16.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Miso? Soy sauce?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.71,0:14:19.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Miso and soy sauce are both made\Nfrom fermented soybeans
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.21,0:14:20.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and are used to add flavor to food.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.92,0:14:22.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fermented?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.50,0:14:23.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Basically...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.71,0:14:29.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It seems that in this world,\Nfermented foods like wine and cheese exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.83,0:14:33.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, they aren't aware of the microorganisms\Nthat actually cause fermentation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.46,0:14:34.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.42,0:14:38.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If tiny organisms that we aren't\Nable to see with our eyes exist,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.71,0:14:42.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and if these organisms can cause\Ntransformations in matter without magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.46,0:14:45.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,then that would serve to explain all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.00,0:14:46.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Eat or talk. Pick one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.13,0:14:47.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It seems that like Lu, she's also\Nvery passionate about her research.\N{\rSubtitle}Eat or talk. Pick one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.63,0:14:49.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It seems that like Lu, she's also\Nvery passionate about her research.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.33,0:14:53.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've found a fascinating new subject\Nfor my research!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.04,0:14:57.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll be sure to bring the wonders of miso and\Nsoy sauce to all who live in these lands!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.71,0:15:02.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And then one day we will all feast upon\Nmiso soup and cold tofu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.54,0:15:05.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After staying here for a few days,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.50,0:15:09.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Flora left with great haste and excitement\Nso that she could make preparations to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.50,0:15:12.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.50,0:15:13.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.50,0:15:15.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was really fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.38,0:15:17.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You even brought the maids with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.67,0:15:21.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.13,0:15:24.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My name is Anne, and I speak on behalf of\Nthe other maids as their representative.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.88,0:15:28.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We ask that you put us to use\Nas you see fit, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.33,0:15:31.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh, you really don't need to be that formal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.17,0:15:33.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, what are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.38,0:15:37.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're just normal cows, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.54,0:15:39.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.17,0:15:42.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I made sure to pick cows to bring\Nwith me that would give us milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.79,0:15:47.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is great.\NNow we can make butter and cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.00,0:15:58.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.92,0:16:00.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What? Why are you so close?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.17,0:16:02.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need to leave for a short while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.29,0:16:03.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.38,0:16:06.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder what she's going off to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.88,0:16:12.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.96,0:16:13.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.96,0:16:16.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've brought my underlings here as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.92,0:16:19.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My name is Granmaria.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.75,0:16:21.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Kudel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.63,0:16:24.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Corone. It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.75,0:16:27.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Daga,\Nthe representative of the lizardmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.63,0:16:30.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I've prepared this here as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.71,0:16:32.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a chicken!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.46,0:16:33.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Does it breathe fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.96,0:16:34.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It does not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.96,0:16:36.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What about eggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.21,0:16:37.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It lays them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.46,0:16:38.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.29,0:16:45.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks to everyone here,\Nthis place just got a lot more civilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.42,0:16:49.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For the rooms on this side, Lamulias,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.17,0:16:51.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want you to dust them\Nbefore we start washing the floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.50,0:16:52.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.00,0:16:55.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, sorry for interrupting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.79,0:16:56.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.79,0:16:59.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The maids belong to a race of ogres.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.38,0:17:02.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess it's to be expected\Nsince they're professionals,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.88,0:17:06.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but as soon as they showed up\Nall of our chores got done a lot faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.75,0:17:07.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.50,0:17:12.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The inhabitants of this world don't seem\Nto cook any complicated dishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.96,0:17:17.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I tried to teach them all the different\Nmethods of cooking that I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.92,0:17:23.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It seems like it got them\Ninterested in cooking all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.04,0:17:26.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dinner is served.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.58,0:17:30.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Today I tried making a dish of\Nkiller rabbit with fragrant vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.13,0:17:33.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow. So those things\Nare called killer rabbits, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.63,0:17:37.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This looks wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.13,0:17:40.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're all very strong,\Ndespite their appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.79,0:17:44.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They display both proper manners\Nand a bit of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.67,0:17:47.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, there are the three angels\Nthat Tia brought with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.79,0:17:51.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now then, you're all to patrol\Na different region of the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.42,0:17:51.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Granmaria, Kudel, and Corone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.88,0:17:54.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I want you to make sure you see everything,\Neven the tiniest of movements.\N{\rSubtitle}Granmaria, Kudel, and Corone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.25,0:17:55.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Understood.\N{\rSubtitle}I was wondering why they all showed up{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}in such serious looking armor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.25,0:17:57.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was wondering why they all showed up\Nin such serious looking armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.54,0:17:59.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It turns out that after the wyvern attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.83,0:18:02.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tia planned on having them\Nact as our security on the premises.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.46,0:18:04.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel safer with them around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.42,0:18:05.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The lizardmen are in charge of all the labor\Nthat requires strength outdoors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.88,0:18:06.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Hey!\N{\rSubtitle}The lizardmen are in charge of all the labor{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}that requires strength outdoors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.96,0:18:08.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The lizardmen are in charge of all the labor\Nthat requires strength outdoors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.29,0:18:10.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'll be over in just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.17,0:18:13.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks to them, our construction work\Nis moving along even faster than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.67,0:18:17.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, I had their leader Daga\Ntie a scarf around his arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.88,0:18:20.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel bad, but I'm not able to\Ntell them apart otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.33,0:18:21.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I guess that makes sense.\N{\rSubtitle}I feel bad, but I'm not able to{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}tell them apart otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.83,0:18:22.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I guess that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.75,0:18:27.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, this place\Nis really filling up with people living here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.33,0:18:29.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How many of us are there now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.38,0:18:33.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.38,0:18:34.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hiraku!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.38,0:18:38.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I brought all the elves that were still\Nwandering the forest over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.04,0:18:39.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.38,0:18:43.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,N-now there are even more...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.21,0:18:44.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are they all women?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.67,0:18:46.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where are the men? I don't see any.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.33,0:18:50.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There weren't really any men who survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.17,0:18:51.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.04,0:18:53.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.17,0:18:56.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can just start making more now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.08,0:18:59.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hope that works out for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.79,0:19:02.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I decided not to ask them\Nhow they planned to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.71,0:19:06.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.79,0:19:10.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who knows? I'm just here\Nbecause I was asked to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.04,0:19:13.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He said to gather all the different\Nrepresentatives here today...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.50,0:19:16.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder if some sort of problem has arisen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.75,0:19:21.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, sorry for calling you all here like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.54,0:19:24.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's something I want to talk about\Nwith all of you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.21,0:19:29.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You see, I want to come up with\Na name for this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.50,0:19:32.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This place here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.08,0:19:33.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:36.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At first, it was just my little hut\Nand some crop fields,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.50,0:19:40.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but then more buildings started popping up\Nand more people started moving in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.17,0:19:42.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's like a village now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.58,0:19:46.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why I want to come up with\Na name for this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.00,0:19:47.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I like that idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.46,0:19:49.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A name for our town!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.00,0:19:53.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can't we just name it after you\Nsince you're the founder?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.83,0:19:54.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.21,0:19:57.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then it'd be something like Hiraku Village,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.17,0:19:58.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,or maybe Machio Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.71,0:20:00.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't really like the sound of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.63,0:20:04.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case, how about we name it\Nafter the forest we're in?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.25,0:20:06.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That sounds like a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.17,0:20:08.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, what's this forest called?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.67,0:20:10.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Forest of Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.29,0:20:11.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What, really? That's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.58,0:20:13.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That makes this The Village of Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.50,0:20:14.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a ghost town.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.75,0:20:16.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It sounds like it'd have a poison swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.67,0:20:19.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.79,0:20:23.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This door?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.33,0:20:25.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You want me to open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.46,0:20:34.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is The Great Tree Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.96,0:20:47.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hello, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.96,0:20:52.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,From now on, we've decided to\Ncall this The Great Tree Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.58,0:20:54.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In celebration of this day,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.83,0:20:56.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we're going to have a party!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.00,0:21:00.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And no party would be complete without this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.33,0:21:03.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The first batch of wine we made\Nhere in The Great Tree Village!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.04,0:21:07.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please enjoy yourselves, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.50,0:21:11.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mayor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.75,0:21:12.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mayor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.96,0:21:19.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Mayor! Mayor!\N{\rSubtitle}No, that's something we need to{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}decide together later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.04,0:21:20.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.71,0:21:22.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're the only one for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.13,0:21:26.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's right.\NEveryone's already calling you mayor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.04,0:21:30.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.29,0:22:26.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're pretty drunk, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.21,0:22:30.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?\NYou're sitting all by yourself zoning out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.21,0:22:32.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.21,0:22:39.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking about how I'm so happy\Nthat this all feels like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.96,0:22:42.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This isn't a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.88,0:22:46.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're all going to keep living together,\Nenjoying our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.79,0:22:49.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.42,0:22:51.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.04,0:22:52.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay then!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.21,0:22:56.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's toast to The Great Tree Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.63,0:22:59.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.42,0:23:01.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.08,0:23:05.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.75,0:23:08.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to toast, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.38,0:23:11.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You were awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.71,0:23:13.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.04,0:23:15.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Very well then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.71,0:23:18.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How many years has it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.54,0:23:19.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.63,0:23:23.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since I've had wine.\NIt tastes better than I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.17,0:23:24.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Gimme another!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.08,0:23:40.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll give it a shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.46,0:23:41.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,as mayor.
